{
    "workflowName": "SYSTEM - GenAI Metadata Generation",
    "category": "SYSTEM - GenAI",
    "description": "Runs the SYSTEM GenAI metadata pipeline on one uploaded file: sys_* attributes, typed ext_* metadata/location and genai_* metadata for every viewer-supported file, plus a per-file-version embedding when vector search is enabled. Locked per file version, so the same version never runs twice concurrently.",
